{"data":[{"date":"2023-09-29","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/13/c5/400602_ZI8Y9.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/13/c5/400602_ZI8Y9.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/13/c5/400602_ZI8Y9.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/13/c5/400602_ZI8Y9.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/13/c5/400602_ZI8Y9.jpg"},"image":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/13/c5/400602_ZI8Y9.jpg","summary":"魔法使芙莉莲和勇者辛美尔等人一起，历经十年的冒险之后击败了魔王，为世界带来了和平。\r\n身为能活上一千多年的精灵族，她于是和辛美尔等人约定再次相见后，踏上了独自一人的旅途。\r\n自那以后，50年过去，芙莉莲又前往拜访辛美尔，相比于和50年前一点没变的她来说，辛美尔已经年迈体衰，进入了风烛残年。\r\n之后，她目睹了辛美尔迎来他的死亡，痛感自己以往没能“知晓人心\"，陷入后悔的芙莉莲，为了“知晓人心\"，踏上了旅途。\r\n这趟旅途会邂逅各种各样的人，也有各种各样的事情在等待着她。","name":"葬送のフリーレン","name_cn":"葬送的芙莉莲","tags":[{"name":"治愈","count":8119,"total_count":307240},{"name":"公路片","count":6504,"total_count":22947},{"name":"奇幻","count":6443,"total_count":487498},{"name":"MADHouse","count":6223,"total_count":112082},{"name":"漫画改","count":5903,"total_count":885965},{"name":"2023年10月","count":4940,"total_count":37917},{"name":"旅行","count":4298,"total_count":8632},{"name":"寿命论","count":3716,"total_count":3843},{"name":"TV","count":3206,"total_count":1436235},{"name":"斋藤圭一郎","count":3163,"total_count":3873},{"name":"异世界","count":2545,"total_count":271167},{"name":"2023","count":1750,"total_count":82683},{"name":"漫改","count":1593,"total_count":368312},{"name":"催泪","count":1445,"total_count":61233},{"name":"日本","count":899,"total_count":309956},{"name":"战斗","count":357,"total_count":485037},{"name":"斎藤圭一郎","count":311,"total_count":1919},{"name":"冒险","count":247,"total_count":56365},{"name":"日常","count":189,"total_count":412194},{"name":"神作","count":160,"total_count":48263},{"name":"公路","count":127,"total_count":1542},{"name":"魔法","count":124,"total_count":20437},{"name":"葬送的芙莉莲","count":107,"total_count":1917},{"name":"恋爱","count":54,"total_count":579276},{"name":"2023年","count":52,"total_count":3670},{"name":"搞笑","count":51,"tot